                <rule id="2082-7883-108e-96cb" name="Armoury Assets" hidden="false">
                  <description>Upgrade 1-2 units in this formation: Land Raider Proteus or Land Raider Phobos to Land Raider Achilles (+25 pts each); Vindicator to Vindicator Laser Destroyer (+20 pts each); Predator to Predator Infernus (+20 pts each); Predator to Predator Executioner (+20 pts each); Predator to Whirlwind Scorpius (+20 pts each). Once this upgrade is taken, the upgraded units appear in the formation and the Tank upgrade, next to the units they replace; pick them there.</description>
